      "doc_id": "b1766364ec3b",
      "text": "Pleased with the transaction. Would purchase again or reccomend to another. It was a good purchase. Confident with the brand. Past time to upgrade from my (rooted) Galaxy S3... loved that 'trooper' of a phone for many years. Please with all the updated features of the S9+. Can't offer any comment on the fingerprint face rec. biometrics extravagant features... Don't really use them myself. Don't let my phone wander off too far so that extent of security i haven't felt the need for up to this point. Satisfied with the seller. Came in under the scheduled date for delivery... that is always a plus. The charging adapter was generic 'run of the mill' but an awesome 2+ amp charger wasn't promoted, so no foul. Since it was a used purchase therefore 2nd owner (which the cost was way more acceptable than paying retail for the thing) makes me wish every device user was wise enough to APPLY a SCREEN protector dammitt.",
