      "row_id": 389675,
      "chunk_id": "32e82d2a07c8_2",
      "doc_id": "32e82d2a07c8",
      "text": "I followed his requests for various troubleshooting steps to identify if it was an app issue or a battery issue- but after a few days of testing this and that, we determined that it was, in fact, the battery. He advised me that it was likely just a fluke- but he had me send the phone to him for an immediate battery replacement. He also offered to send me a loaner phone to use while my battery was being replaced, but I went ahead and used my old glitchy phone. Within just a few days, I had my phone back with a brand new battery and voila- problem fixed. Folks- I don't often write reviews like this, because honestly... does anyone even read them? But I want to assure any future customers that this seller will go above and beyond. NEVER ONCE did I feel like he was avoiding me.",
